# Sega CD conversation (segacd_game.cpp, talk mode): in the throne room the
# second command row is DUKE LETO ATREIDES; tapping it shows Leto's portrait
# (bank 1782, measured placement) over the room's close-up backdrop with his
# first line in the orange box; a tap in the view shows the next line;
# STOP TALKING (second row) returns to the throne room.
wait 1500
move 120 188
click left 120 188
wait 1000
checkpoint segacd-talk-leto-1
move 160 80
click left 160 80
wait 1000
checkpoint segacd-talk-leto-2
move 120 188
click left 120 188
wait 1000
checkpoint segacd-talk-back
quit
